abstract: "Literature catalog of the 112 works cited in the survey, released evaluation splits, detector and contribution-analysis results, representation diagnostics on eight Qwen2.5 configurations, and the code that rebuilds the diagnostic tables and figures. MIT applies to original software; third-party datasets keep their upstream terms."
